1
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:05,640
This child has muscle wasting and mosaic
variegated aneuploidy, a condition in which

2
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,160
cells can carry different numbers of
chromosomes.

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:12,360
Our question is whether an existing medicine
could improve muscle function while

4
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,960
preserving the cells needed for growth and
repair.

5
00:00:15,209 --> 00:00:18,000
We propose two medicines for laboratory
testing.

6
00:00:19,832 --> 00:00:23,480
BUB1B makes the checkpoint protein BUBR1.

7
00:00:23,697 --> 00:00:29,480
Our stop-plus-missense pair matches a reported
MVA1 pattern: reduced protein supply.

8
00:00:29,824 --> 00:00:33,240
The missense protein's stability and function
remain unmeasured.

9
00:00:33,435 --> 00:00:35,320
Trans phase needs confirmation.

10
00:00:35,599 --> 00:00:40,120
Confirmed cis retires this pair as the
compound-heterozygous explanation.

11
00:00:41,956 --> 00:00:46,240
Niacin is our lead because it targets the
protein-supply hypothesis.

12
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:49,600
It raised muscle NAD in another myopathy.

13
00:00:49,934 --> 00:00:55,040
Separate experiments connect NAD and SIRT2 to
BUBR1 stability.

14
00:00:55,308 --> 00:00:57,760
Niacin has not rescued this genotype.

15
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:01,440
We test whether it increases usable protein
and useful muscle.

16
00:01:03,279 --> 00:01:05,720
Everolimus is our downstream probe.

17
00:01:05,905 --> 00:01:09,400
It inhibits mTORC1, a growth pathway.

18
00:01:09,587 --> 00:01:14,480
A small carrier-mouse blot showed stronger
phosphoprotein bands, without quantified

19
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,560
pathway activity.

20
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:19,640
Rapamycin preserved stem-cell numbers in a
different fly model.

21
00:01:19,754 --> 00:01:21,640
Neither establishes muscle rescue.

22
00:01:21,826 --> 00:01:25,320
We require functional benefit with preserved
growth and renewal.

23
00:01:27,158 --> 00:01:30,720
Our cell-selection explorer exposes a
misleading result.

24
00:01:30,850 --> 00:01:35,960
In one simulated scenario, the chromosome-
normal fraction rose sixteen point eight

25
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:40,560
percentage points while total differentiated-
cell time fell eleven percent.

26
00:01:40,869 --> 00:01:44,320
Other teams can inspect this tradeoff across
declared assumptions.

27
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:49,080
Our proposed experiment tracks starting cells,
including those that die or stop

28
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:49,760
dividing.

29
00:01:51,536 --> 00:01:56,080
We would compare affected and genetically
corrected muscle models, using measured drug

30
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,000
exposures.

31
00:01:57,359 --> 00:02:02,240
A medicine must improve either existing muscle
or new muscle production, preserve the

32
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:05,160
other, and avoid worsening chromosome errors.

33
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:08,360
Independent confirmation must reproduce the
result.

34
00:02:08,634 --> 00:02:12,720
The cancer history also requires checking that
neither medicine helps tumor cells

35
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:15,400
survive or interferes with cancer treatment.

36
00:02:17,234 --> 00:02:21,760
Arimoclomol remains a reserve because rescue
of this protein is unproved.

37
00:02:22,097 --> 00:02:27,240
Removing senescent cells has strong genetic
mouse evidence, but some drugs also damage

38
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,640
repair in young muscle.

39
00:02:28,752 --> 00:02:31,040
We investigate that mechanism in parallel.

40
00:02:31,228 --> 00:02:35,840
Transcript rescue and other alternatives have
explicit promotion tests in our report.

41
00:02:37,674 --> 00:02:42,360
We also ran the workflow on a public,
synthetic TRIP13 example.

42
00:02:42,717 --> 00:02:48,040
It shows why a BUBR1 restoration hypothesis
cannot simply transfer to another gene.

43
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:51,560
That demonstrates reuse, not treatment
validation.

44
00:02:52,056 --> 00:02:56,720
Next we need a consented muscle model and
laboratory partner to test niacin, with

45
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:58,360
everolimus as comparator.
